# Secrets — broad on purpose. The narrow ".env*" patterns below used to miss
# files like "env.example" and "env-local-updated", which is how real Neon,
# Cloudflare R2 and Clerk credentials ended up committed to a public repo.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env*
**/env.*
**/env-local*
*.pem
*.key
.vercel

